# The toolchain is byte-exact: content hashes (packs), golden comparisons, and
# oracle freshness diffs all assume LF. Pin it so an autocrlf checkout cannot
# spuriously fail G5 or the golden corpus.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Datalog fixtures carry symbol values with leading or trailing spaces on
# purpose (the symbols parity program). Exempt them from the whitespace check.
internal/datalog/testdata/** -whitespace
